{"steam_appid":3894440,"steam_name":"NO BACKUP","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3894440/1696903364/360b592e225c3fd7cfc207539fa5e05000cf611b/1776360335/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1776361127","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257320990/cbb1e58e7a19f1c7587c28ed8bd5204a5933e853/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1776361127","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/db8735c9e14ff69208e87f0602938509675cb84f/ss_db8735c9e14ff69208e87f0602938509675cb84f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780443332","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/ce8088e144a2333d373c002c49df4a8cb09af56a/ss_ce8088e144a2333d373c002c49df4a8cb09af56a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780443332","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/5a707ecd3aad15fe17c3f12f88b58bb9c5d9be93/ss_5a707ecd3aad15fe17c3f12f88b58bb9c5d9be93.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780443332","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/233fde8872b20b1ab2585735b3584bae23ad6022/ss_233fde8872b20b1ab2585735b3584bae23ad6022.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780443332","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/66029a1c8b0fec0e82597c3af8a1b890353b8581/ss_66029a1c8b0fec0e82597c3af8a1b890353b8581.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780443332"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re part of a special ops team. Armed with your bodycam, weapon and a radio, you’re sent into an abandoned zone. The mission: get out alive, together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something is hunting you. Silent. Relentless. One wrong move, and it’s over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/e81bbcda23574e0a9a1829449d446911.avif?t=1780443332\" width=418 height=89 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to three friends in intense co-op gameplay.<br>You’ll need to stick together, cover each other, and plan every move - or you won’t make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use in-game voice chat to coordinate, but choose your words wisely: the monster hears you.<br>Panic, split up, or hesitate for even a second and someone won’t come back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/bc7f33fc1ee916c17030f91b8bd15902.avif?t=1780443332\" width=418 height=89 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/8cb17f532b1bcbb96ef6799f0289808c.poster.avif?t=1780443332\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/8cb17f532b1bcbb96ef6799f0289808c.webm?t=1780443332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/8cb17f532b1bcbb96ef6799f0289808c.mp4?t=1780443332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See what your character sees. The entire game is viewed through a shaky, immersive bodycam with  no health bars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The limited field of view and unstable movement create a disturbing sense of realism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not watching a horror movie.<br>You’re in one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/16747cdb397b536b764ab05c557eab86.avif?t=1780443332\" width=418 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/38737ad3367294b79ac6d033220da985.poster.avif?t=1780443332\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/38737ad3367294b79ac6d033220da985.webm?t=1780443332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/38737ad3367294b79ac6d033220da985.mp4?t=1780443332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are scarce. Every bullet counts. Every medkit is a blessing.<br>Search abandoned lockers, toolboxes, and rooms for essential supplies: batteries for your flashlight, healing items, ammo, keys, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory is limited. Share with your team or keep it for yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/9ddceb66a74989f17c327cb09db97a36.avif?t=1780443332\" width=418 height=89 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/6e46d7ab8e57c6a5e1ccaac9ef069603.poster.avif?t=1780443332\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/6e46d7ab8e57c6a5e1ccaac9ef069603.webm?t=1780443332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/6e46d7ab8e57c6a5e1ccaac9ef069603.mp4?t=1780443332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It listens to your footsteps. It tracks your voice. It observes your strategies and adapts.<br>Every decision matters, and every sound you make brings death one step closer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/02207108dc330da7803ff9d75edb0da5.avif?t=1780443332\" width=418 height=89 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/eea7afeb2a38c30cbc487398b935a844.poster.avif?t=1780443332\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/eea7afeb2a38c30cbc487398b935a844.webm?t=1780443332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/eea7afeb2a38c30cbc487398b935a844.mp4?t=1780443332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From derelict hospitals and underground bunkers to dark forests and empty corridors, every location oozes tension.<br>Flickering lights. Distant echoes. Breathing in your headset. Footsteps that aren’t yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700K / AMD Ryzen 7 5800X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2070 / AMD RX 6700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie","Early Access"],"developers":["Serundeox"],"publishers":["Serundeox"],"release_date":"May 9, 2026"}